# 🎲 AETHERIA — RECRUITMENT SYSTEM

> **Recruitment is the process of discovering new Heroes from the remaining fragments of Aetheria.**
>
> Every recruitment result is generated through the **RNG System**, validated by the **Character / Hero System**, registered by the **Game State System**, and stored in the **Database System**.
>
> **Newly recruited Heroes are automatically registered into the Master's Inventory before they can be assigned to a Party.**

---

# 1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW

Recruitment System bertanggung jawab untuk menghasilkan Hero baru.

Sistem terhubung dengan:

```text
