Flow:

```text
RNG RESULT
 ↓
CHARACTER RESULT
 ↓
DUPLICATE CHECK
 ↓
┌───────────────┐
│               │
NEW           DUPLICATE
│               │
↓               ↓
ACCEPT        REROLL
```

