# 51. IMPORTANT RULES

### Rule 1

> Recruitment wajib menggunakan RNG System.

### Rule 2

> Character / Hero System menentukan data final Hero.

### Rule 3

> Tidak boleh ada duplicate Hero.

### Rule 4

> Hero hasil recruitment secara default masuk Inventory.

### Rule 5

> Hero tidak otomatis masuk Party.

### Rule 6

> Hero yang masuk Party wajib menjalani Training Ground.

### Rule 7

> Hero yang belum selesai training tidak dianggap Mission Ready.

### Rule 8

> Semua perubahan recruitment harus melalui Game State System.

### Rule 9

> Semua data penting recruitment disimpan di Database System.

### Rule 10

> AI Fairy harus dapat melaporkan hasil recruitment kepada Master.

